.TH PICKDNS-DATA 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pickdns-data \- compile a pickdns database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pickdns-data
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads pickdns source data from
.I data
in the current directory and writes the compiled database
.IR data.cdb .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pickdns (1)
